# 指向可以直接访问的 FastAPI。nginx 的 8080 也把 /api/ 和 /browser-auth/ 转给 FastAPI。
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@username = outfit_demo
@password = local-demo-password

### 1. 服务状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. 注册（首次执行；已有同名账号时可直接执行下一步）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### 3. 登录并保存后续请求用的 JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

> {%
if (response.status === 200) {
    client.global.set("outfitToken", response.body.data.token);
}
%}

### 4. 当前账号
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{outfitToken}}

### 5. 分页历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/list?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{outfitToken}}

### 6. 上传（先把有权使用的 outfit.jpg 放到本文件旁边，或修改下面路径）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/create
Authorization: Bearer {{outfitToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=OutfitUploadBoundary

--OutfitUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="outfit.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./outfit.jpg
--OutfitUploadBoundary--

> {%
if (response.status === 202) {
    client.global.set("outfitAnalysisId", response.body.data.id);
}
%}

### 7. 查询上传任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/detail/{{outfitAnalysisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{outfitToken}}

### 8. 更新备注
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/note/{{outfitAnalysisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{outfitToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note":"对照检测框和豆包描述"}

### 9. 分页校验（应返回 HTTP 422）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/list?pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{outfitToken}}

### 10. 删除记录（任务结束后执行）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/delete/{{outfitAnalysisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{outfitToken}}
